      "kind": "aside",
      "source": {
        "text": "Although it’s not a real word, テアイダ (teaida) could potentially mean \"between hands\" or \"a match-up between two competitors\", among other things.",
        "raw": "Although it's not a\nreal word, 77-1-J'\n(teaida) could\npotentially mean\n\"between hands\" or \"a\nmatch-up between\ntwo competitors\",\namong other things",
