    {
      "id": "p0167-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In late 2018, Toby released Chapter 1 of a new game he called Delta rune. Suddenly, the anagram connection between \"Undertale\" and \"Delta Rune\" became clear to many more fans around the world. Had the Japanese translation of Undertale stuck with \"Teaida Rune\", though, this after-the-fact connection might've been lost in translation.",
        "raw": "In late 2018, Toby released Chapter 1 of a new game he called Delta rune.\nSuddenly, the anagram connection between \"Undertale\" and \"Delta Rune\"\nbecame clear to many more fans around the world. Had the Japanese\ntranslation of Undertale stuck with \"Teaida Rune\", though, this after-the-fact\nconnection might've been lost in translation.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
